rprised they aren't handling correctly these simple videos although, at the same time, Theora hasn't seen much acceptance and it's already deprecated.\n\nI've added the command to generate the test.ogv file to the first message that was generated using ffmpeg.\n\nTheora being old and the only codec supported, we should be able to optimize the videos. Having to use the minimum keyframe interval for bug-free playing takes away a lot of the compression benefits.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2604013861/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2604493964","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101837#issuecomment-2604493964","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101837","id":2604493964,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bPWyM","user":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-21T11:42:20Z","updated_at":"2025-01-21T11:42:35Z","body":"I've tried the example player from libtheora and it plays both files correctly except that the test.ogv video ends too soon, just as it happens with mpv.\n\nThe last frames of test.ogv are identical and seemingly ignored. This abrupt ending of the video might be more closely related to #21568 and #66331.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2604493964/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]